r higher"],["DirectX","Version 9.0c"],["Network","Broadband Internet connection"],["Storage","8 GB available space"]],"deck":3,"blurb":"Based on the Games Workshop tabletop game of the same name, this is a turn-based tactics title set in a ruined Empire city in the Warhammer setting. You lead a warband through lethal skirmishes against rival groups, all hunting for fragments of Wyrdstone left behind when a comet struck the city.\n\nCampaigns combine RPG progression with detailed unit customization, so your fighters gain skills and gear over time. Playable warbands include the Sisters of Sigmar. Battles are fast and unforgiving, and you can play the single-player campaign or take on other players online. It suits tactics fans who accept that units will be lost."}}